<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1521', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 20, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>算力的物理边界</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14 }}>地面方案，已经在物理上先撞墙了</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#3A4653', marginTop: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, marginTop: 22, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 540, borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/gpu_cluster.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: '100%', padding: 14, background: 'linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(6,14,26,0.9) 0%, rgba(6,14,26,0) 100%)' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9CFE7' }}>正在建设中的超大计算集群</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>黄仁勋给出的数字</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 104, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4', lineHeight: 1 }}>1.95</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#A9CFE7', paddingBottom: 12 }}>/ 2 吨</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 8 }}>一个机架里，97.5% 的重量是冷却系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9CCCE', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>真正在计算的那部分，只占很小一块。电力与散热，取代芯片本身，成为下一个约束。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, background: '#162534', borderRadius: 6, padding: 16, borderLeft: '3px solid #8ED1A8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>马斯克从另一端算：美国年用电约 460 吉瓦，1 太瓦在地面根本不可能。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#63A7D4', borderRadius: 6, padding: 15, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#08131F' }}>结论：</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#08131F' }}>当机架 97.5% 的重量都在散热，下一个价值池就藏在"电"和"冷"里。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
